| `sortedScan` | Definitional summary, total over `(ValSeq, Val, Int)` | Empty/less/equal/greater cases are pairwise disjoint. For equality, duplicate counts `<0`, `=0`, and `>=1` cover all integers. Recursive cases consume a strict tail. | Both claims |
